# Plan: Oracle + Terminal + Image Gen Activation

## Context

Oracle chat produces cold/generic responses because the `/api/oracle/stream` SSE endpoint bypasses all Oracle personality infrastructure — it calls Ollama directly with no system prompt. The terminal is completely non-functional because the WebSocket server broadcasts outbound only (no incoming message handler) and the HTTP fallback sends `{ command }` while the endpoint expects a predefined `{ commandKey }`. Image folder opener is broken for the same mismatch reason. These are all plumbing disconnects, not missing features.

